Cell["\<\
In the thesis, the factor of C is factored out of the polynomial expression. \
Also, as ArcCoth[(C-1)/C]=Log[1-2C]/2 for C>1, this part is readily included \
in the other Log term in the thesis. In the supplement python solver, the \
ArcCoth term is written out, however defining (as seen in python solver) \
arccoth = log/2.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.994998426810378*^9, 3.994998427305855*^9}, {
  3.995965725878681*^9, 
  3.995965916005144*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"97370c10-9bb6-4022-8949-\
11ee3a77bba7"]
}, Open  ]],

